 real and personal property, collects assessments and delinquent taxes, manages forfeiture of property for delinquent taxes, administers elections and voter registration, issues county liquor licenses, tobacco license as well as other miscellaneous licenses.\nThe County Auditor-Treasurer is responsible for mailing and collecting real estate, personal property, manufactured home, transmission line and severed mineral interest taxes.\nResponsible for apportionments, collections and disbursements of taxes collected to all taxing jurisdictions as provided by State law.\nContact Us:\nOffice Hours 8:00 a.m. to 4:30 p.m. Monday thru Friday\nShare this page\n×\nCopy and paste this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://www.pinecountymn.gov/departments/auditor/index.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nReddit\nClose\nINFORMATION\nE-Notify\nOffice Locations\nContact Us\nFacebook Links\nEverbridge Notifications\nQUICK LINKS\nJail Roster\nBudget Book\nComprehensive Plan\nElection Information\nActive Warrants\nEmployees\nNews\nEvent Calendar\nContact Us\nContact Us\n-->\n635 Northridge Drive NW, Pine City MN 55063\n(320)591-1400\nContact Information\nPowered by revize. Government Website Experts | Login | 635 Northridge Drive NW, Pine City MN 55063 - Questions? (320)591-1400\nOriginal text\nRate this translation\nYour feedback will be used to help improve Google Translate\nClose Read More",
